        "输入为流和环境张量界；微分与积分估计由这些输入推出。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "length_energy",
      "title": "加权曲率能量控制",
      "kind": "theorem",
      "math_statement": "\\mathcal E(t)=\\int q\\,ds,\\qquad\\int_a^b e^{-B(t-a)}\\mathcal E(t)\\,dt\\le L(a)-e^{-B(b-a)}L(b).\\quad B\\ge0\\Rightarrow\\int_a^b\\mathcal E(t)\\,dt\\le e^{B(b-a)}L(a)-L(b).",
      "explanation": "长度导数中的负曲率能量项给出指数加权积分估计，可用于下游选取合适时刻。",
      "lean": [
        {
          "module": "CurveControl.Geometry.LengthEstimates",
          "file": "CurveControl/Geometry/LengthEstimates.lean",
          "declarations": [
